    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/82f96caf8327ca80a0405e32a4fee5be.poster.avif?t=1754233502\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/82f96caf8327ca80a0405e32a4fee5be.webm?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/82f96caf8327ca80a0405e32a4fee5be.mp4?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><i>you Had Embarked to the Outer Rim.</i></strong><br><br><strong><i>The Ship You Were On Has Been Boarded.</i></strong><br><br><i>Now you\u2019re waking up in a jail complex on an unknown planet, beaten and left for dead.</i><br><br>Find a way out of here and get back to earth in <strong>FLAW</strong>, a retro-FPS<strong> inspired by cult classics</strong>: Unreal, Half-Life, Halo and many other. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/4bca266ad48471744923e2db396ed512.poster.avif?t=1754233502\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/4bca266ad48471744923e2db396ed512.webm?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/4bca266ad48471744923e2db396ed512.mp4?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You and the Flaming Dawn\u2019s passengers have been abducted while on the way to a distant colony on the Outer Rim. You were looking for a better life among the stars, you have yet found only despair and darkness.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run</h2> through the metal environment of this hive-planet and face many living and dead dangerous creatures. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/2f8a617a2078f3a6db87c94f0a3df0b1.poster.avif?t=1754233502\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/2f8a617a2078f3a6db87c94f0a3df0b1.webm?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/2f8a617a2078f3a6db87c94f0a3df0b1.mp4?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shoot </h2>your way out of here and use any weapons your fallen enemies had but be careful on your bullets management.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rescue </h2>the crew and the passengers of the Flaming Dawn. Even if most of them are civilians without proper training, any help can make the difference.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape </h2>a fate worse than death and uncover the truth behind these abductions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/ebdac730000346ebcdfed04a4469c2ff.poster.avif?t=1754233502\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/ebdac730000346ebcdfed04a4469c2ff.webm?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/ebdac730000346ebcdfed04a4469c2ff.mp4?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/82f96caf8327ca80a0405e32a4fee5be.poster.avif?t=1754233502\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/82f96caf8327ca80a0405e32a4fee5be.webm?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/82f96caf8327ca80a0405e32a4fee5be.mp4?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><i>you Had Embarked to the Outer Rim.</i></strong><br><br><strong><i>The Ship You Were On Has Been Boarded.</i></strong><br><br><i>Now you\u2019re waking up in a jail complex on an unknown planet, beaten and left for dead.</i><br><br>Find a way out of here and get back to earth in <strong>FLAW</strong>, a retro-FPS<strong> inspired by cult classics</strong>: Unreal, Half-Life, Halo and many other. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/4bca266ad48471744923e2db396ed512.poster.avif?t=1754233502\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/4bca266ad48471744923e2db396ed512.webm?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/4bca266ad48471744923e2db396ed512.mp4?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You and the Flaming Dawn\u2019s passengers have been abducted while on the way to a distant colony on the Outer Rim. You were looking for a better life among the stars, you have yet found only despair and darkness.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run</h2> through the metal environment of this hive-planet and face many living and dead dangerous creatures. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/2f8a617a2078f3a6db87c94f0a3df0b1.poster.avif?t=1754233502\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/2f8a617a2078f3a6db87c94f0a3df0b1.webm?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/2f8a617a2078f3a6db87c94f0a3df0b1.mp4?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shoot </h2>your way out of here and use any weapons your fallen enemies had but be careful on your bullets management.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rescue </h2>the crew and the passengers of the Flaming Dawn. Even if most of them are civilians without proper training, any help can make the difference.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape </h2>a fate worse than death and uncover the truth behind these abductions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/ebdac730000346ebcdfed04a4469c2ff.poster.avif?t=1754233502\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/ebdac730000346ebcdfed04a4469c2ff.webm?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2510060/extras/ebdac730000346ebcdfed04a4469c2ff.mp4?t=1754233502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
